From 2c94a5d90fa5424470ece13ca6b4187d4322e3f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Colliers <mail@thomascolliers.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 22:37:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] media: qcom: camss: add CSIPHY v2.2.1 (milos) lane config

Add the D-PHY lane register sequence and ~1.1 Gbps/lane (500 Msps)
datarate/AFE tuning for the CSIPHY v2.2.1 revision on milos (register
window at offset 0x1000), transcribed from the downstream
cam_csiphy_2_2_1_hwreg.h.

Signed-off-by: Thomas Colliers <mail@thomascolliers.com>
---
 .../qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c         | 162 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 162 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
index 415483274..2bc2552b5 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
@@ -801,6 +801,159 @@ csiphy_lane_regs lane_regs_x1e80100[] = {
 	{0x0C64, 0x7F, 0x00, CSIPHY_SKEW_CAL},
 };
 
+/*
+ * Milos (SM7635) CSIPHY v2.2.1, DPHY (2-phase) 4-lane mode.
+ * Translated from the downstream cam_csiphy_2_2_1_hwreg.h (2ph reg sequence).
