+ * generic common-ctrl writes in csiphy_lanes_enable() land correctly; here we
+ * add the DPHY mode select (CTRL0=0x02), the v2.2.1 common regs, and the full
+ * per-lane tuning. Skew-cal entries are skipped (as for the other gen2 PHYs).
+ */
